intro:
  heading: "Commercial & Residential Foundation Digging"
  paragraphs:
    - >
      A durable building starts with precise foundation excavation. S. Phaneuf & Associates provides foundation digging, footing excavation, and basement site preparation for commercial facilities, custom residential homes, and building additions throughout Massachusetts.
    - >
      We excavate foundation trenches to exact engineer elevation specs, remove organic topsoil and unsuitable clay, and compact a crushed stone base to support concrete footings.
    - >
      Following concrete foundation wall curing, our heavy equipment crews perform perimeter foundation backfilling with crushed gravel and install perimeter foundation drain pipes to keep basements dry.

